# deploy/butane/overlays/prod/etc-containers-systemd.bu
#
# Deploys prod-specific podman/quadlet unit files and symlinks for /etc/containers/systemd.
# Creates instance symlinks for the local-path volume template (appdata, default, nvme),
# then overlays the prod files tree on top of the base tree written by
# deploy/butane/base/etc-containers-systemd.bu.  The prod tree supplies per-instance
# volume drop-ins (e.g. local-path@appdata.volume.d/) and the prod-specific
# k3s@agent-0 container drop-in.
